      "level": 1,
      "topic": "daily life",
      "title_zh": "爸爸生病了",
      "title_en": "Dad got ill",
      "paragraphs": [
        ["昨天", "，", "爸爸", "生病", "了", "，", "他", "不", "能", "去", "上班", "。"],
        ["他", "打", "电话", "说", "：", "“", "今天", "我", "不", "能", "去", "开会", "了", "。", "”"],
        ["我", "和", "妈妈", "给", "他", "做", "了", "饭", "。", "他", "吃", "了", "一些", "，", "就", "去", "睡觉", "了", "。", "妈妈", "说", "：", "“", "你", "要", "多", "休息", "。", "”"],
        ["晚上", "，", "妹妹", "给", "爸爸", "唱歌", "。", "爸爸", "说", "：", "“", "真", "好听", "！", "”"],
        ["第二", "天", "，", "爸爸", "好", "了", "。", "他", "笑", "着", "说", "：", "“", "谢谢", "你们", "！", "”"]
      ],
      "translations": [
        "Yesterday Dad got ill and couldn't go to work.",
        "He phoned and said: “I can’t come to the meeting today.”",
        "Mum and I cooked for him. He ate a little, then went to bed. Mum said: “You need to rest more.”",
        "In the evening my little sister sang to Dad. Dad said: “That’s lovely!”",
        "The next day Dad was better. He smiled and said: “Thank you all!”"
      ],
      "names": [],
      "new_words": ["生病", "开会", "好听"],
      "glossary": [
        { "word": "生病", "english": "to get ill" },
        { "word": "开会", "english": "to have a meeting" },
        { "word": "好听", "english": "nice to listen to" }
      ]
    },
    {
