      "title_zh": "我的钱包",
      "title_en": "My wallet",
      "paragraphs": [
        ["上", "个", "月", "，", "我", "在", "上海", "玩", "。", "有", "一", "天", "，", "我", "到", "了", "车站", "，", "想", "买", "票", "。"],
        ["我", "找", "我", "的", "钱包", "，", "找", "不", "到", "了", "！", "我", "不", "知道", "要", "做", "什么", "。"],
        ["一", "个", "女人", "来", "了", "，", "手", "里", "拿", "着", "我", "的", "钱包", "！"],
        ["她", "说", "：", "“", "这", "是", "你", "的", "吗", "？", "我", "在", "路上", "看到", "的", "。", "”", "我", "说", "：", "“", "太", "谢谢", "您", "了", "！", "”"],
        ["我", "很", "高兴", "，", "就", "走路", "回去", "了", "。"]
      ],
      "translations": [
        "Last month I was in Shanghai. One day I got to the station and wanted to buy a ticket.",
        "I looked for my wallet — I couldn’t find it! I didn't know what to do.",
        "A woman came up, holding my wallet!",
        "She said: “Is this yours? I saw it on the road.” I said: “Thank you so much!”",
        "I was so happy that I walked back."
      ],
      "names": ["上海"],
      "new_words": ["车站", "钱包", "走路"],
